{"2353050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "WTF - Waifu Tactical Force", "steam_appid": 2353050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Exclusive Playtests and More!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/c8b6b6e078b32b6bd2aae752160f00bb.avif?t=1786631207\" width=1200 height=250 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/29baa0e31f14afa46c351515a5377355.avif?t=1786631207\" width=800 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/d7572dfd00dd4629031d5d41fed528ff.poster.avif?t=1786631207\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/d7572dfd00dd4629031d5d41fed528ff.webm?t=1786631207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/d7572dfd00dd4629031d5d41fed528ff.mp4?t=1786631207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WTF is an anime-style first-person tactical movement shooter. Slide, wall-run, and double jump your way through frenetic combat designed with mobility and verticality in mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn streaks to call down your mech and dominate the match. Win matches to earn resources to build your Mother Base and unlock guns, perks, abilities, and skins to take back into battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati