mized for 60+ FPS on low-spec devices (GTX 1000-series and Steam Deck)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No intrusive FOMO or battlepass bloat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/29baa0e31f14afa46c351515a5377355.avif?t=1786631207\" width=800 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/d7572dfd00dd4629031d5d41fed528ff.poster.avif?t=1786631207\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/d7572dfd00dd4629031d5d41fed528ff.webm?t=1786631207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/d7572dfd00dd4629031d5d41fed528ff.mp4?t=1786631207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WTF is an anime-style first-person tactical movement shooter. Slide, wall-run, and double jump your way through frenetic combat designed with mobility and verticality in mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn streaks to call down your mech and dominate the match. Win matches to earn resources to build your Mother Base and unlock guns, perks, abilities, and skins to take back into battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/0b17c1ee57033f7af41fb8365303fcfd.avif?t=1786631207\" width=800 height=207 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a